## 📋 Summary
In the twilight hours, Caius wielded THE SWORD restlessly in the training yard, while Elen listened intently for whispers from the thin Veil beyond. Meanwhile, Peredur sought answers to his Grail devotion, diligently scribbling on parchment by candlelight. Unnoticed, Sioned's absence cast a heavy void amidst the party, as the Fisher King briefly appeared before vanishing mysteriously.
